      "content": "it’s not a noise you can just call someone to fix. it’s just... this nothingness. i look at the horizon and i don't see a future, i just see a long, slow decay. if you were really my friend, you'd understand that some things are just too broken to be mended. you'd see that everything i touch just turns to ash. tell me the truth, elara... is there even a point to trying anymore? or is it just more suffering waiting for us at the end of the road?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
